[I] A D-Bus abstraction layer that allows the user to manage packages

[T] A D-Bus abstraction layer that allows the user to manage packages in a
[T] secure way using a cross-distro, cross-architecture API.

[U] https://github.com/PackageKit/PackageKit

[A] PackageKit
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.4.1

